  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child rights Karamja ABEK</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Child rights Karamja ABEK</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet omfattar fr&#xe4;mjande av barns r&#xe4;ttigheter genom utbildning    bland pastoralister i Karamojaregionen. Den alternativa               basutbildningen f&#xf6;r Karamoja (ABEK) s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;ller tillg&#xe5;ng till        utbildning f&#xf6;r barnen i Karamoja och &#xf6;verg&#xe5;r senare i formell         grundutbildning. Det svenska st&#xf6;det &#xe4;r 6 MSEK under tre &#xe5;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to promote child rights in the pastoral Karamoja   region through education.  The Alternative Basic Education for        Karamoja (ABEK) ensure access to education for Karamajong children    who later transition to formal education.                              The total Swedish support is 6 MSEK for 3 years.</narrative>
  </description>
